  "notes": "{避難|ひなん} means escaping danger to take refuge in a safe place ({避|ひ} avoid/escape + ⟦{難|なん}→難：00452_nan⟧ danger).\n\nCOMPOUNDS:\n- ⟦{避難所|ひなんじょ}→避難所：07374_hinanjo⟧: evacuation shelter\n- {避難|ひなん}⟦{指示|しじ}→指示：09674_shiji⟧: evacuation order (most urgent)\n- {避難|ひなん}⟦{勧告|かんこく}→勧告：05828_kankoku⟧: evacuation advisory\n- {避難|ひなん}⟦{訓練|くんれん}→訓練：02673_kunren⟧: evacuation drill\n\nWATCH OUT: {避難|ひなん}⟦{指示|しじ}→指示：09674_shiji⟧ (order) is more urgent than {避難|ひなん}⟦{勧告|かんこく}→勧告：05828_kankoku⟧ (advisory) — and it is easy to confuse this word with the unrelated ⟦{非難|ひなん}→非難：14616_hinan⟧ (criticism, blame), which shares the reading ひなん.\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{防災|ぼうさい}→防災：07907_bousai⟧: disaster prevention\n- ⟦{逃|に}げる→逃げる：01151_nigeru⟧: to escape (more general, everyday)\n- ⟦{疎開|そかい}→疎開：13589_sokai⟧: wartime evacuation to the countryside\n\nREGISTER: Neutral; common in news and emergency contexts.",
